<title>THAILAND: Thai Telephone 1996 net profit lower.</title>
<headline>Thai Telephone 1996 net profit lower.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated financial results</p>
<p>for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		0.64	vs	     1.66</p>
<p>    Net		     424.22	vs	   830.51</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Thai Telephone and Telecommunication Plc, an operator of fixed-line telephone.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
